+ * Three functions are made available to check what selection of data is
+ * present in a key object: OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_has_parameters(),
+ * OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_has_public_key(), and OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_has_private_key(),
